137
00:10:20,315 --> 00:10:21,755
[SPEAKER_01]: And that experience is manifested.

138
00:10:22,335 --> 00:10:37,181
[SPEAKER_01]: So, then, you assuming yourself as, like, external to it, and then observing of its linear progression, linear kind of endurance in time, whereby a thing arises, oh, it's still there, and now it's gone.

139
00:10:38,201 --> 00:10:40,402
[SPEAKER_01]: But, see, you left yourself completely out.

140
00:10:40,942 --> 00:10:41,863
[SPEAKER_01]: It's irrelevant.

141
00:10:43,517 --> 00:10:50,460
[SPEAKER_01]: And, you also fail to see that even now, the experience of now this thing is gone, that is present for you.

142
00:10:51,541 --> 00:10:57,803
