144
00:11:01,705 --> 00:11:12,410
[SPEAKER_01]: For as long as you've been thinking about it and exist in your, like, well, even for as long as your five aggregates exist with this intact memory in the mind, that thing has its form of, has a form of its presence.

145
00:11:13,032 --> 00:11:16,654
[SPEAKER_01]: Even if you can't find its material counterpart anymore.

146
00:11:16,714 --> 00:11:18,214
[SPEAKER_01]: Or other material aspects.

147
00:11:18,494 --> 00:11:19,695
[SPEAKER_01]: It's not exactly a counterpart.

148
00:11:20,715 --> 00:11:22,776
[SPEAKER_01]: Which is how you can still think about people.

149
00:11:22,816 --> 00:11:23,357
[SPEAKER_01]: They're died.

150
00:11:23,897 --> 00:11:24,497
