152
00:11:26,278 --> 00:11:26,858
[SPEAKER_01]: They haven't.

153
00:11:27,498 --> 00:11:28,079
[SPEAKER_01]: That's the thing.

154
00:11:28,479 --> 00:11:32,041
[SPEAKER_01]: As a phenomenon, those things are still manifesting in your experience.

155
00:11:33,321 --> 00:11:37,603
[SPEAKER_01]: As the external projection of the matter and stuff, whatever else wrong views people might have,

156
00:11:38,358 --> 00:11:55,068
[SPEAKER_01]: Where you think the world exists independent of you, or you exist independent of the world, or both, or neither, or you're confused in regard to it, then, yeah, you will believe that this material aspect is the thing, but then, see, then you can't account for your thinking of it when that matter disappears.

157
00:11:56,169 --> 00:12:01,112
[SPEAKER_01]: But the thing was never in the matter, nor was never in your mind, in your consciousness.

158
00:12:01,332 --> 00:12:03,073
[SPEAKER_01]: The thing was always comprised of both.

159
00:12:04,346 --> 00:12:10,049
[SPEAKER_01]: So now, it's that very absence of that matter that stands for the matter of that thing when you think about it.

160
00:12:10,369 --> 00:12:11,310
[SPEAKER_01]: A negative matter.

161
00:12:12,310 --> 00:12:12,430
[SPEAKER_01]: Ah!

162
00:12:12,851 --> 00:12:14,792
[SPEAKER_01]: This, my favorite thing, is gone.

163
00:12:15,332 --> 00:12:16,432
[SPEAKER_01]: It used to be right here.

164
00:12:17,093 --> 00:12:23,056
[SPEAKER_01]: So now, the empty space becomes the material aspect of the matter you're thinking about.

165
00:12:23,356 --> 00:12:24,877
[SPEAKER_01]: Because it was always name and matter.

166
00:12:27,417 --> 00:12:36,961
[SPEAKER_01]: But the views that people have, projects, gives the priority to the matter, which is why you keep looking for the distraction of the matter, to find the proof for impermanence.

167
00:12:37,681 --> 00:12:42,823
[SPEAKER_01]: But there is no external proof for impermanence, because that's another thing that arises, and another thing that you can take to be permanent.

168
00:12:44,804 --> 00:12:53,627
